---
import { withBase } from "../lib/paths.mjs";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout
  title="Meet Joe & Saris"
  description="Meet Joe and Saris, the Colorado makers behind Honey Path Designs. Original art, handmade earrings, and unexpected finds with a second life."
>
  <section class="page-intro wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">The people behind the little things</span><h1>
      Two makers.<br /><em>One happy hive.</em>
    </h1><p>Hi, we’re Joe and Saris. It’s lovely to meet you.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="story-section wrap about-story">
    <div class="story-photo">
      <img
        src={withBase("/images/8851b74455106131dcf67508d5a8f556.jpg")}
        alt="Joe and Saris together"
        width="639"
        height="799"
      /><span class="photo-label">Joe + Saris. Hearts + hands.</span><span
        class="photo-flower"><Icon name="flower" size={76} /></span
      >
    </div><div class="story-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Midwestern roots. Colorado hearts.</span><h2>
        Following our<br /><em>own honey path.</em>
      </h2><p>
        We’re a husband-and-wife duo originally from the Midwest, now living in
        Colorado with our kiddo, our two amazing partners, and our dog.
      </p><p>
        Honey Path Designs is where our creative worlds meet. Saris makes our
        stickers, art prints, and graphic design elements. Joe creates our
        earrings and key chains, mostly from materials found at closing stores
        and garage sales.
      </p><p>
        We love a piece with personality. A familiar character, an unexpected
        material, a little color that makes your day. That’s what you’ll find in
        our hive.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section wrap">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Different hands. The same heart.</span><h2>
          A little of <em>both of us.</em>
        </h2>
      </div>
    </div><div class="maker-grid">
      <article class="maker-card tint-1">
        <span class="eyebrow">The illustrator</span><h3>Saris</h3><p>
          Original illustrations, stickers, art prints, and the graphic elements
          that give Honey Path its personality.
        </p><a class="text-link" href={withBase("/shop?category=Stickers")}
          >Explore the illustrations <Icon name="arrow" /></a
        ><img
          src={withBase("/images/e33bd90462a89543101e1db311a2cfb5.png")}
          alt="Saris’ playful ghost sticker"
          width="170"
          height="210"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </article><article class="maker-card tint-2">
        <span class="eyebrow">The maker</span><h3>Joe</h3><p>
          Handmade earrings and key chains, with a love of upcycling finds from
          closing stores and garage sales.
        </p><a class="text-link" href={withBase("/shop?category=Earrings")}
          >Explore the earrings <Icon name="arrow" /></a
        ><img
          src={withBase("/images/ca82980be8d7c4983fb6c906f7406a18.png")}
          alt="Joe’s purple guitar pick earrings"
          width="170"
          height="210"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="closing-section wrap">
    <Icon name="bee" size={40} /><h2>Welcome to <em>our hive.</em></h2><p>
      Thanks for being part of our little corner of the world.
    </p><a class="button" href={withBase("/shop")}
      >Find a little something <Icon name="arrow" /></a
    >
  </section>
</Layout>
